{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1042.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"873b91b9f2c6080a6da79a2504681afcf758314f451622d4d4986510741f84f7","ja":"ええと、次は……こっちの質問……。","zh":"那个，接下来是……这个问题……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1042.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3caafe28f211a8fbd74e820e4e38bbc473e29a94e124e131b0d8741b27b44bdf","ja":"おっ、もう準備進めてるのか。\nネットで事前に質問を募集したんだよな。","zh":"哦，已经开始准备了吗。\n之前在网上征集过问题了吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1042.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"95c0dd30a5e2926557eb5849d488ad56ab94f7ea7d2d9e2cfbafc66b19e4bece","ja":"うん……新しいアイディアが、出ないとき……\nどうしたら、いいって……質問が、来てて……。","zh":"嗯……有提问问到……\n想不出新点子的时候……\n该怎么办才好……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1042.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"64e7a70dab8c76cac9929e7475a78e2f6c0259c447e58df4c0ac144ffe4fb948","ja":"……！\nそれで、アンナはどう答えるつもりなんだ？","zh":"……！\n那么，杏奈打算怎么回答呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1042.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"85096d2bee89571b98d31f87b708f1f5303ed008417c25519f85791438a9e3de","ja":"……いつもと、ちがう場所に……\n行ってみる、とか……かなって……。","zh":"……去和平时不一样的、地方……\n看看，之类的……吧……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1042.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"bd2ab363c8cd7ebd7f4086bbddffa2620350a67f7d7bec9de6b9c967c839ac92","ja":"ゲームでも……詰んだときは……\n別の場所……探険、してみるから……。","zh":"在游戏里也是……卡关的时候……\n就会试着……去探索别的地方……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1042.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"1b92048b0672275080d4414de57b619c3941409b78cc12a9a91ab562b65ae2a7","ja":"なるほどな……そっか！\nさっそくやってみるよ。ありがとな、アンナ！","zh":"原来如此啊……这样啊！\n我这就去试试看。谢谢你啊，杏奈！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1042.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a300638bc15e55b74ac62f6a1e24772de9151f5fbe560d742290cf3cc4382738","ja":"どう、いたしまして……？","zh":"不、不用谢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1042.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"a413290c997fef84a536920266475eac1a6c2938765efa14eec4ddfa7f561e98","ja":"（って、ギター持って飛び出してみたけど……\nここからどうしたらいいんだ？）","zh":"（话说回来，虽然拿着吉他冲了出来……\n接下来该怎么办才好呢？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1042.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"0fbe1bb94c74237dc55ba6ea6128ea3bf64bcfbd215910e6139cdda107618ab9","ja":"（…………。\nとりあえず、歌ってみるか）","zh":"（…………。\n总之，先唱唱看吧）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
