{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1042.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"8a1233cacbf224d2a25b11465b775994f8bb291ca5ed16232c12236f6e4dd887","ja":"（あれ、あの子……目が少し赤い。\nさっきまで泣いてたのか？　でも今は……）","zh":"（咦，那个女孩子……眼睛有点发红。\n刚才哭过了吗？不过现在……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
